Z||000000||FieroGrrrl||10-10-2000||05:39 PM||||Hello everyone,<P>I just registered with your BB and it looks like I could get to like it here!  Reading along the old posts I've seen a bunch of things I have had to deal with on my own Fiero! How comforting!  I own an 88 Formula and I fix (for my boyfriend's dad) and 84 2m4 SE, so I will most likely be here quite often!<P>Right now I'm repairing the thermostat housing on the 84, as well as replacing all the belts he didn't notice where gone, and replacing the coolant temp sensor.  After this comes the CV joint and I don't think I'm going to touch that one...<P>I just finished repairing/replacing the slave and master clutch cylinders in the 88 and now I'm searching for the reason I'm only getting 19 miles to the gallon!?!  Last time I checked I wasn't driving a Cadillac...<P>anyhoo, nice meeting you all and hope to share with you soon!<P>~Fierogrrrl||||reg||12
